    |                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Ordinary fallible calls propagate automatically; `CryptoError` can reach `Err` only through `impl CryptoError -> Err`
 Fix: Handle this call locally with `??`, add `impl CryptoError -> Err { … }`, or change the return type
